2026-07-27T09:51:15.2502472Z i /tmp/Rtmpv2otez/duckdb
2026-07-27T09:51:15.2502943Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T09:51:15.2503490Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T09:51:15.2503955Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T09:51:15.2505006Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T09:51:15.2506130Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T09:51:15.2507386Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
